WEBVTT

1
00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:30.333


2
00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:32.541
<b>Lord Krishna speaks here,</b>

3
00:00:32.541 --> 00:00:36.250
<b>That which is unreal has no existence,</b>

4
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:40.750
<b>and that which is real can never cease to exist</b>

5
00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.458
<b>it is eternal,</b>

6
00:00:42.458 --> 00:00:44.166
<b>everlasting.</b>

7
00:00:44.166 --> 00:00:46.375
<b>This fundamental truth</b>
<b>about reality and unreality</b>

8
00:00:46.375 --> 00:00:50.500
<b>has been perceived and proclaimed</b>
<b>by the great seers of truth.</b>

9
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.791
<b>Shri Krishna,</b>

10
00:00:51.791 --> 00:00:55.875
<b>through this medium, explains that</b>
<b>materiality is temporary</b>

11
00:00:55.875 --> 00:00:59.291
<b>while the soul is infinite.</b>

12
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.208


13
00:01:04.208 --> 00:01:06.375
<b>Lord Krishna says</b>

14
00:01:06.375 --> 00:01:08.916
<b>that those who are the supreme</b>
<b>knowers of spirituality,</b>

15
00:01:08.916 --> 00:01:13.125
<b>through their experience and continuous study,</b>
<b>have reached this very conclusion:</b>

16
00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:14.833
<b>That whatever is material,</b>

17
00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:16.166
<b>worldly,</b>

18
00:01:16.166 --> 00:01:18.083
<b>is temporary.</b>

19
00:01:18.083 --> 00:01:19.916
<b>And whatever is spiritual,</b>

20
00:01:19.916 --> 00:01:21.333
<b>is permanent,</b>

21
00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:23.375
<b>infinite.</b>

22
00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:26.625
<b>Though Lord Krishna himself is all-knowing,</b>

23
00:01:26.625 --> 00:01:33.208
<b>he still makes reference to</b>
<b>these supreme spiritual masters.</b>

24
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:36.708
<b>He does this to remind Arjuna of</b>
<b>an important point.</b>

25
00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:37.875
<b>In the first chapter,</b>

26
00:01:37.875 --> 00:01:40.833
<b>Arjuna Vishada Yoga,</b>
<b>you might have noticed </b>

27
00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:43.625
<b>you might have noticed that while</b>
<b>presenting his arguments,</b>

28
00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:47.750
<b>Arjuna frequently cited knowledge</b>
<b>gained from various teachers.</b>

29
00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:48.750
<b>Here, Krishna</b>

30
00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.833
<b>wishes to tell Arjuna</b>

31
00:01:50.833 --> 00:01:54.208
<b>that while you have indeed acquired knowledge,</b>

32
00:01:54.208 --> 00:01:55.916
<b>perhaps</b>

33
00:01:55.916 --> 00:02:00.750
<b>you haven't properly understood</b>
<b>its fundamental basis.</b>

34
00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:02.958
<b>The foundation of spiritual knowledge</b>

35
00:02:02.958 --> 00:02:07.125
<b>lies in understanding the distinction</b>
<b>between the material and the spiritual.</b>

36
00:02:07.125 --> 00:02:08.666
<b>One is temporary,</b>

37
00:02:08.666 --> 00:02:11.041
<b>and one is eternal.</b>

38
00:02:11.041 --> 00:02:13.791
<b>This is the conclusion of the supreme knowers.</b>

39
00:02:14.416 --> 00:02:18.333


40
00:02:18.333 --> 00:02:21.625
<b>When difficult times arrive in life,</b>

41
00:02:21.625 --> 00:02:24.666
<b>we often become so distressed</b>

42
00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:28.166
<b>that we feel as though these</b>
<b>moments will never pass,</b>

43
00:02:28.166 --> 00:02:32.000
<b>that these hardships will never fade away.</b>

44
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.166
<b>Yet the truth is</b>

45
00:02:34.166 --> 00:02:36.125
<b>and we all know this</b>

46
00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:39.458
<b>every difficult phase eventually passes.</b>

47
00:02:39.458 --> 00:02:44.833
<b>Just open the window to</b>
<b>your past and peek through</b>

48
00:02:44.833 --> 00:02:48.416
<b>how many challenging times</b>
<b>must have come and gone,</b>

49
00:02:48.416 --> 00:02:51.666
<b>how many times must you have felt</b>

50
00:02:51.666 --> 00:02:54.208
<b>that this moment would never pass,</b>

51
00:02:54.208 --> 00:02:57.375
<b>but each time, it did pass.</b>

52
00:02:57.375 --> 00:03:01.541
<b>It is the very nature of time to move on.</b>

53
00:03:01.541 --> 00:03:07.500
<b>It is we who create such</b>
<b>worrisome pictures in our minds</b>

54
00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:14.916
<b>that our circumstances appear far</b>
<b>more severe than they actually are.</b>

55
00:03:14.916 --> 00:03:19.083
<b>Whenever you find yourself trapped</b>
<b>in extreme difficulty,</b>

56
00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:21.958
<b>try to remember this:</b>

57
00:03:21.958 --> 00:03:26.625
<b>whatever is worldly is temporary.</b>

58
00:03:26.625 --> 00:03:28.083
<b>It shall pass.</b>

59
00:03:28.083 --> 00:03:33.000
<b>Don't make the mistake of believing</b>
<b>your difficulties are permanent.</b>

60
00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:37.333
<b>And alongside this,</b>
<b>make spirituality your foundation,</b>

61
00:03:37.333 --> 00:03:40.791
<b>for that foundation will remain eternal.</b>

62
00:03:40.791 --> 00:03:45.083
<b>When you connect yourself with such stability,</b>

63
00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:49.458
<b>when you maintain thoughts</b>
<b>that nourish your soul,</b>

64
00:03:49.458 --> 00:03:52.166
<b>when you lean towards spirituality</b>

65
00:03:52.166 --> 00:03:58.833
<b>you'll find yourself handling these momentary</b>
<b>worldly difficulties with remarkable ease.</b>

66
00:03:59.416 --> 00:04:03.458


67
00:04:03.458 --> 00:04:09.416
<b>The responsibility of parents isn't merely</b>
<b>to care for their children,</b>

68
00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:13.916
<b>nor is it simply to provide them protection.</b>

69
00:04:13.916 --> 00:04:17.208
<b>Parents carry a far greater responsibility</b>

70
00:04:17.208 --> 00:04:23.041
<b>to teach their children morality and life values,</b>

71
00:04:23.041 --> 00:04:29.833
<b>so that as they grow, they can clearly distinguish</b>
<b>between right and wrong.</b>

72
00:04:29.833 --> 00:04:32.083
<b>But</b>

73
00:04:32.083 --> 00:04:34.416
<b>is this happening?</b>

74
00:04:34.416 --> 00:04:36.583
<b>Look into your home,</b>

75
00:04:36.583 --> 00:04:38.750
<b>observe your surroundings.</b>

76
00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:44.500
<b>We're providing our children with</b>
<b>education from prestigious institutions,</b>

77
00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:49.166
<b>we're preparing them for various competitions,</b>

78
00:04:49.166 --> 00:04:55.791
<b>and by immersing ourselves in material</b>
<b>comforts, we're teaching them the same lesson.</b>

79
00:04:55.791 --> 00:04:58.250
<b>However, we forget</b>

80
00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:01.791
<b>that whenever life presents us</b>
<b>with moments of adversity,</b>

81
00:05:01.791 --> 00:05:03.375
<b>it's our thinking,</b>

82
00:05:03.375 --> 00:05:07.166
<b>our spiritual foundation - the stronger it is,</b>

83
00:05:07.166 --> 00:05:13.416
<b>the better we can face that adversity.</b>

84
00:05:13.416 --> 00:05:15.708
<b>If you truly want</b>

85
00:05:15.708 --> 00:05:19.458
<b>your children's future to be bright,</b>

86
00:05:19.458 --> 00:05:25.166
<b>then along with teaching them the importance</b>
<b>of worldly comforts and material resources,</b>

87
00:05:25.166 --> 00:05:26.958
<b>also teach them</b>

88
00:05:26.958 --> 00:05:32.750
<b>that life's true foundation</b>
<b>lies in spiritual knowledge.</b>

89
00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:36.000
<b>With an inclination towards spirituality,</b>
<b>with this wisdom,</b>

90
00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:40.208
<b>they will surely excel in life's</b>
<b>other competitions as well.</b>

91
00:05:40.833 --> 00:05:45.083


92
00:05:45.083 --> 00:05:49.208
<b>Many great industries come and go,</b>

93
00:05:49.208 --> 00:05:53.000
<b>many high-ranking officials come and go.</b>

94
00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.625
<b>This change is simply a rule of existence.</b>

95
00:05:55.625 --> 00:05:56.833
<b>But</b>

96
00:05:56.833 --> 00:05:58.791
<b>what remains?</b>

97
00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:02.583
<b>What remains are the values born</b>
<b>from spiritual knowledge.</b>

98
00:06:02.583 --> 00:06:06.416
<b>These never change.</b>

99
00:06:06.416 --> 00:06:07.875
<b>What is essential?</b>

100
00:06:07.875 --> 00:06:10.000
<b>That which will soon pass away,</b>

101
00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.708
<b>or that which will stay forever?</b>

102
00:06:13.708 --> 00:06:16.291
<b>Whenever you face multiple choices,</b>

103
00:06:16.291 --> 00:06:21.916
<b>here's a simple way to choose the right one.</b>

104
00:06:21.916 --> 00:06:29.750
<b>Ask yourself, which among these</b>
<b>options is centered on spiritual foundation,</b>

105
00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:34.333
<b>and which will have a lasting impact.</b>

106
00:06:34.333 --> 00:06:41.291
<b>When you attempt to make decisions based on</b>
<b>these two aspects spirituality and permanence </b>

107
00:06:41.291 --> 00:06:47.375
<b>you will surely experience clarity in thoughts</b>
<b>and confidence in mind.</b>

